# PEP 561 marker: this package ships inline type annotations, so type
# checkers (Pylance/Pyright, mypy) analyze it as a typed package instead of
# reporting reportMissingTypeStubs on `from xyberos_vision import ...`.
# Setuptools ships this file by default; pyproject.toml also declares it under
# [tool.setuptools.package-data] so the intent survives a change to that default.
